        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9023/153, Industrial Hanger 6 Inch Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's 6 Inch Hangar Cabinet Pull is a great example of industrial chic decor. The modern design is great when paired with the top finishes in home decorating designing trends like satin brass, polished chrome, and satin nickel. The Industrial Hanger 6 Inch Cabinet Handle has a 6-1/2 inch overall length and a 1-3/8 inch projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9023\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/10-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9023 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sold Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
